<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>It's a keyboard and mouse macro for Car Mechanic Simulator 2018, who wants to get bolt related achievements. </Description>
    <Comment>Purchase dodge DLC (the one with dodge SRT in it, there are 2 dodge DLCs), disassemble the engine part until you get to the part that has 10X2 bolts. Align your camera so 10 bolts are overlapped, start the macro.  </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 500 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 4400 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyDown 41 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 41 1
Delay 100 ms
GoWhile 1 20000000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Car Mechanic Simulator 2018</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>